OL,3,GNEWSARob Burrow Centre for MND marks   
OL,4,Afirst anniversary                      
OL,6,FPatients, families and staff have      
OL,7,Fcelebrated the first anniversary of the
OL,8,Fopening of the Rob Burrow Centre for   
OL,9,FMotor Neurone Disease (MND) in Leeds.  
OL,11,FOne year ago, Prince William officially
OL,12,Fopened the centre at Seacroft Hospital,
OL,13,Fwhich followed a #6.8m fundraising     
OL,14,Fcampaign led by Leeds Hospitals        
OL,15,FCharity.                               
OL,17,FThe centre is the first purpose-built  
OL,18,Ffacility dedicated entirely to MND     
OL,19,Fcare, dreamt up by former Leeds Rhinos 
OL,20,Fplayer Rob Burrow before he passed away
OL,21,Ffrom the disease in 2024.              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
